, "text": " Every prisoner who goes in comes out after exactly 15 minutes and he waits at the door", "words": [[16.5, 16.7, " Every"], [16.7, 17.02, " prisoner"], [17.02, 17.26, " who"], [17.26, 17.46, " goes"], [17.46, 17.72, " in"], [17.72, 18.02, " comes"], [18.02, 18.28, " out"], [18.28, 18.58, " after"], [18.58, 19.18, " exactly"], [19.18, 19.66, " 15"], [19.66, 19.98, " minutes"], [19.98, 20.26, " and"], [20.26, 20.46, " he"], [20.46, 20.64, " waits"], [20.64, 20.8, " at"], [20.8, 20.92, " the"], [20.92, 21.12, " door"]]}, {"start": 21.12, "end": 21.94, "text": " with a stopwatch.", "words": [[21.12, 21.3, " with"], [21.3, 21.44, " a"], [21.44, 21.94, " stopwatch."]]}, {"start": 22.2, "end": 26.84, "text": " So the first guy they throw in is the biggest inmate in the building, 300 pounds of tattoos", "words": [[22.2, 22.3, " So"], [22.3, 22.42, " the"], [22.42, 22.66, " first"], [22.66, 22.84, " guy"], [22.84, 23.02, " they"], [23.02, 23.22, " throw"], [23.22, 23.44, " in"], [23.44, 23.62, " is"], [23.62, 23.76, " the"], [23.76, 24.14, " biggest"], [24.14, 24.5, " inmate"], [24.5, 24.66, " in"], [24.66, 24.74, " the"], [24.74, 25.08, " building,"], [25.38, 25.88, " 300"], [25.88, 26.16, " pounds"], [26.16, 26.4, " of"], [26.4, 26.84, " tattoos"]]}, {"start": 26.84, "end": 28.1, "text": " laughing at the walls.", "words": [[26.84, 27.44, " laughing"], [27.44, 27.7, " at"], [27.7, 27.82, " the"], [27.82, 28.1, " walls."]]}, {"start": 28.1, "end": 32.38, "text": " But, when they pull him out 15 minutes later, the scientist asks the skinniest guard there", "words": [[28.1, 28.5, " But,"], [28.5, 28.72, " when"], [28.72, 28.84, " they"], [28.84, 29.02, " pull"], [29.02, 29.12, " him"], [29.12, 29.3, " out"], [29.3, 29.64, " 15"], [29.64, 29.86, " minutes"], [29.86, 30.24, " later,"], [30.44, 30.5, " the"], [30.5, 30.8, " scientist"], [30.8, 31.2, " asks"], [31.2, 31.44, " the"], [31.44, 31.92, " skinniest"], [31.92, 32.14, " guard"], [32.14, 32.38, " there"]]}, {"s